  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Log: https://gist.github.com/seanedwards/20e7854106482a9a9904bca45768a0d2\n\nI'm getting a null reference exception for an unknown reason when loading my avatar.\n\n* Only happening on the open beta branch\n* Happens in both VR mode and screen mode\n\nUpdate: Based on the latest beta release notes, I believe this was resolved:\n\n- If an avatar has defined a VRChat built-in parameter, an error will be printed to log and the avatar's definition of that parameter will be ignored\n- If an avatar re-defines an already-defined parameter, an error is printed to log and only the first definition is used\n\nI think this describes the issue I was seeing.\n\nI will update this issue if I find out more.",
